-- Regression fixture for smucclaw/l4-ide#906.
--
-- A DIAMOND over the embedded-library fallback:
--
--     main  ->  { actus-daycount, actus-schedule }  ->  daydate
--
-- Both `actus-daycount` and `actus-schedule` `IMPORT daydate`, and
-- `actus-schedule` uses `Days in month` (defined in `daydate`). This file lives
-- alone in its directory, so none of these modules resolve on disk; with
-- JL4_LIBRARY_PATH unset and an empty XDG store the whole closure is served by
-- the LSP/Shake embedded-library fallback (jl4-lsp/src/LSP/L4/Rules.hs).
--
-- Under the pre-fix resolver the second sibling was type-checked against a
-- starved dependency environment — `daydate`'s exports never reached
-- `actus-schedule` — so `Days in month` was reported out of scope and the whole
-- check failed. See the CLI test in jl4/tests-cli/Main.hs.
IMPORT `actus-daycount`
IMPORT `actus-schedule`
